  ('TL2-28','Upper Mangatepopo Assist',2,'Tongariro','2024, Version 9','Scope Training and assessment Path The instructor with L2 Upper Mangatepopo assist competency Observation can be done by an instructor with L2 can: competency Assist managing groups in the Upper Mangatepopo River, Upper Mangatepopo River Trip including upstream to the high point access and down through all Assessor must be a Senior Instructor with the Upper the jumps above the Mangatepopo Falls abseil. Mangatepopo Trip Leader. Assessment is by direct supervision Must Have level 1 River Safety Note: The Mangatepopo Falls Abseil is a separate L3 Competency Prerequisites Recorded Recognition of Current L1 River Safety Competence: 2 trips without students or as an observer • NZOIA Canyon Leader A s elf O b s 1 O b s 2 ssesso r Technical Competence 1. Demonstrate knowledge of gear and the Mangatepopo River system.','{"self": "Self", "obs1": "Obs 1", "obs2": "Obs 2", "assess1": "Assessor"}',1),
