  ('CL1-30',230,'General',null,'Manoeuvring the boat -manoeuvre the boat for effective rescue and communication',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL1-30',240,'General',null,'Instructor manoeuvres the boat in conditions of more than 10 knots: • Follows the legal speed limits (5 Knots within 200m of shore or 50m from boat or swimmer) • Comes alongside jetty, manoeuvring the boat to stop parallel with and close to jetty without using reverse gear • Comes alongside Jetty- using reverse to parallel park • Comes alongside a capsized dinghy manoeuvring the boat to allow access while keeping the motor as far away from people as possible • Comes alongside a moving boat • Maintains a fixed position relative to a drifting boat',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL1-30',250,'General',null,'• Retrieves a buoy',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL1-30',260,'General',null,'Manoeuvres on the plane • Turns on the plane • Uses engine trim to alter boat trim for load and sea conditions.',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL1-30',270,'General',null,'Anchoring -Anchor support boat in deep water. Anchor boat and back into beach.',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL1-30',280,'General',null,'Anchors boat: • Scope of at least 3:1, 5:1 if leaving boat • Sets anchor with reverse thrust • Firmly secures warp • Minimises dragging anchor over pontoons.',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL1-30',290,'General',null,'Rescues people and equipment. • Retrieves a ‘Thing Overboard’ within one minute from a planning boat - Turns stern away from MOB, gets crew to spot, comes right alongside in upwind direction at slow speed, turns engine off, picks thing up. • Throws a throw rope in choppy conditions and drags a swimmer to boat. • Tows 2 or more sailing dinghies, either behind, alongside or on their rails',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL1-30',300,'General',null,'Retrieve boat from water, wash and put away: • Backs trailer into water, tilts outboard up, brings boat onto trailer and attaches safety • Winches boat up with ratchet on • Ensures boat is correctly orientated on trailer and secured for road travel • Pulls boat to wash down area, removes bungs internal and external • Washes down the interior, exterior of boat trailer and tractor, flushes outboard (ensuring the flush plug is re-attached) • Checks and tops up with fuel if necessary • Tilts engine up and parks in the shed',false,false,false,true,false,false),
