  ('CL2-10',210,'Internal Competency',null,'Prepare boat as a support vessel for students in other craft • Checks fuel tank has sufficient fuel for the day’s activities and emergencies • Completes all the daily pre-departure checks • Ensure engine is in tilted up position before transport',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',220,'Internal Competency',null,'Launching • Launches without damaging boat or engine, minimises exposure of trailer and vehicle to salt water • Pushes or paddles boat out to where there is sufficient water to tilt down engine',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',230,'Internal Competency',null,'Starting • Starts, checks that the cooling system is working (tell-tale)',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',240,'Internal Competency',null,'Manoeuvring the boat -manoeuvre the boat for effective rescue and communication',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',250,'Internal Competency',null,'Instructor manoeuvres the boat in conditions of more than 15 knots: • Follows the legal speed limits (5 Knots within 200m of shore or 50m from boat or swimmer) • Comes alongside jetty, manoeuvring the boat to stop parallel with and close to jetty without using reverse gear • Comes alongside Jetty- using reverse to parallel park • Comes alongside a capsized dinghy manoeuvring the boat to allow access while keeping the motor as far away from people as possible • Comes alongside a moving boat • Maintains a fixed position relative to a drifting boat • Retrieves a buoy',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',260,'Internal Competency',null,'Manoeuvres on the plane • Turns on the plane',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',270,'Internal Competency',null,'• Uses engine trim to alter boat trim for load and sea conditions.',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',280,'Internal Competency',null,'Anchoring -Anchor support boat in deep water. Anchor boat and back into beach.',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',290,'Internal Competency',null,'Anchors boat: • Scope of at least 3:1, 5:1 if leaving boat • Sets anchor with reverse thrust • Firmly secures warp • Minimises dragging anchor over pontoons (e.g. Not damaging the boats pontoons when deploying anchor).',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',300,'Internal Competency',null,'Rescues people and equipment. • Retrieves a ‘Thing Overboard’ within one minute from a planning boat - Turns stern away from MOB, gets crew to spot, comes right alongside in upwind direction at slow speed, turns engine off, picks thing up. • Throws a throw rope in choppy conditions and drags a swimmer to boat. • Tows 2 or more sailing dinghies, either behind, alongside or on their rails',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',310,'Internal Competency',null,'Retrieve boat from water, wash and put away: • Backs trailer into water, tilts outboard up, brings boat onto trailer and attaches safety • Winches boat up with ratchet on • Ensures boat is correctly orientated on trailer and secured for road travel • Pulls boat to wash down area, removes bungs internal and external • Washes down the interior, exterior of boat trailer and tractor, flushes outboard (ensuring the flush plug is re-attached) • Checks and tops up with fuel if necessary • Tilts engine up and parks in the shed',false,false,false,true,false,false),
  ('CL2-10',320,'Internal Competency',null,'Incident history from key incidents (noted in the AMP) has been passed on and understood',false,false,false,true,false,false),
